    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4e0dcb87272e11c",
      "translationZh": "令人印象深刻的是，Mixtral Instruct 在 MT-Bench 上的表现超越了所有其他开放访问模型，并且是首个达到与 GPT-3.5 相当性能的模型！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2b0560e220d8dcfc",
      "translationZh": "关于名称",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "358da5044587c72c",
      "translationZh": "Mixtral MoE 被命名为 Mixtral-8x7B，但它并没有 56B 个参数。发布后不久，我们发现有些人被误导，以为该模型的行为类似于由 8 个各有 7B 个参数的模型组成的集成，但 MoE 模型并不是这样工作的。模型中只有部分层（前馈模块）被复制；其余参数与一个 7B 模型相同。总参数量并不是 56B，而是约 45B。Mixtral-45-8e 或许是一个更好的名称，能更准确地传达其架构。有关 MoE 工作原理的更多细节，请参阅我们的《混合专家详解》文章。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e283de02e19f9df0",
      "translationZh": "提示词格式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5ef6cc5b8fe7f0e",
      "translationZh": "基础模型没有提示词格式。与其他基础模型一样，它可以为输入序列生成合理的后续内容，也可以用于零样本／少样本推理。它也是针对你自己的用例进行微调的良好基础。Instruct 模型的对话结构非常简单。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d745f2c53af79c01",
      "translationZh": "要有效使用，必须严格复现这一格式。稍后我们会展示，使用 transformers 中提供的聊天模板来复现指令提示词是多么容易。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b995f20a6ba0d6af",
      "translationZh": "我们尚不了解的情况",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "864553c39a29a558",
      "translationZh": "与此前发布的 Mistral 7B 一样，这一新系列模型仍有若干待解的问题。尤其是，我们没有任何关于预训练所用数据集的规模、组成或预处理方式的信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1cef8e48ca47873b",
      "translationZh": "同样，对于 Mixtral instruct 模型，尚未公布有关微调数据集或与 SFT 和 DPO 相关的超参数的任何细节。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8a2cc0673b1c4283",
      "translationZh": "演示",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bca787788eabf5aa",
      "translationZh": "你可以在 Hugging Face Chat 上与 Mixtral Instruct 模型聊天！在这里试试：https://huggingface.co/chat/?model=mistralai/Mixtral-8x7B-Instruct-v0.1。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ae5b8a4c6ac9aa79",
      "translationZh": "推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c9cd405a45a3ea3",
      "translationZh": "我们提供了两种使用 Mixtral 模型运行推理的主要方式：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "123532af928dab8b",
      "translationZh": "通过 🤗 Transformers 的 pipeline() 函数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e0ccc81ae8f24a90",
      "translationZh": "使用 Text Generation Inference，它支持连续批处理、张量并行等高级功能，可实现极快的推理速度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e4a0c779af553e4",
      "translationZh": "对于每种方法，都可以使用半精度（float16）或量化权重来运行模型。由于 Mixtral 模型的大小大致相当于一个具有 45B 参数的稠密模型，我们可以按如下方式估算所需的最低 VRAM 容量：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5d65f0ae389b602",
      "translationZh": "精度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dce47fae1a7b4b65",
      "translationZh": "所需显存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f44de6cc2a814bf",
      "translationZh": "大于90 GB",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "928f7dabd6fd0914",
      "translationZh": "8 位",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0119",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f9956aeafc08998",
      "translationZh": "大于45 GB",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "511b782e904437ac",
      "translationZh": "4 位",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0122",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "74986d675900999d",
      "translationZh": "使用 🤗 Transformers",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0123",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6637f992d05d4dd5",
      "translationZh": "借助 transformers 4.36 版本，你可以使用 Mixtral，并利用 Hugging Face 生态系统中的所有工具，例如：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0124",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ce8cfcdc9e839a21",
      "translationZh": "训练和推理脚本及示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0125",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ed89844584690c08",
      "translationZh": "安全的文件格式（safetensors）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0126",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2c1cbffbd35e572a",
      "translationZh": "与 bitsandbytes（4 位量化）、PEFT（参数高效微调）和 Flash Attention 2 等工具的集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0127",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9a327c4a3bb24935",
      "translationZh": "用于运行模型生成任务的实用工具和辅助工具",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0128",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "35bdf50d18bf2e52",
      "translationZh": "用于导出模型以进行部署的机制",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0129",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "002b050853d1ee56",
      "translationZh": "请确保使用较新版本的 transformers：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0130",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "908f8bf8f2c0898d",
      "translationZh": "在下面的代码片段中，我们展示了如何使用 🤗 Transformers 和 4 位量化运行推理。由于模型体积很大，你需要一张至少拥有 30 GB 显存的显卡才能运行它。这包括 A100（80 或 40GB 版本）或 A6000（48 GB）等显卡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0131",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f59ae79c5435611f",
      "translationZh": "<s>[INST] 用少于 100 个词解释什么是混合专家。[/INST] 混合专家是一种集成学习方法，它将多个模型（即“专家”）组合起来，以做出更准确的预测。每个专家专门处理不同的数据子集，而门控网络则决定针对给定输入应使用哪个专家。这种方法使模型能够适应数据中复杂的非线性关系，并提升整体性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0132",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4fae040f896f841d",
      "translationZh": "使用 Text Generation Inference",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0133",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee44e02749883a4d",
      "translationZh": "Text Generation Inference 是由 Hugging Face 开发的可用于生产环境的推理容器，旨在让大型语言模型的部署变得简单。它具备连续批处理、词元流式传输、用于在多个 GPU 上快速推理的张量并行，以及可用于生产环境的日志记录和追踪等功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0134",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d70a244337b83034",
      "translationZh": "你可以在 Hugging Face 的 Inference Endpoints 上部署 Mixtral，该服务使用 Text Generation Inference 作为后端。要部署 Mixtral 模型，请前往模型页面，点击 Deploy -> Inference Endpoints 组件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0135",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "494ad7d60d8cfce1",
      "translationZh": "注意：你可能需要通过电子邮件向 api-enterprise@huggingface.co 申请提高配额，才能使用 A100。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0136",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ed35961200fd740",
      "translationZh": "你可以在我们的博客中进一步了解如何使用 Hugging Face Inference Endpoints 部署大型语言模型。该博客介绍了受支持的超参数，以及如何使用 Python 和 Javascript 流式传输响应。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0137",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "863dbaf88e66e108",
      "translationZh": "你也可以使用 Docker，在本地的 2 张 A100（80GB）上运行 Text Generation Inference，具体如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0138",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "176de3c46bbd93ab",
      "translationZh": "使用 🤗 TRL 进行微调",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0139",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99c0fe815bb43bfe",
      "translationZh": "训练 LLM 在技术和计算资源方面都可能颇具挑战。在本节中，我们将介绍 Hugging Face 生态系统中可用的工具，以便在单张 A100 GPU 上高效训练 Mixtral。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0140",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48d0674e2f44bb7a",
      "translationZh": "下方给出了在 OpenAssistant 的聊天数据集上微调 Mixtral 的示例命令。为了节省内存，我们使用 4 位量化和 QLoRA，将注意力模块中的所有线性层作为目标。请注意，与稠密 Transformer 不同，不应将 MLP 层作为目标，因为这些层是稀疏的，与 PEFT 的配合效果不佳。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0141",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69d568ddd6c6538f",
      "translationZh": "首先，安装 🤗 TRL 的每夜构建版本，并克隆仓库以获取训练脚本：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0142",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6790d9a9a02fd23",
      "translationZh": "然后就可以运行脚本：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0143",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff1b0a97e936bf6e",
      "translationZh": "在单张 A100 上训练大约需要 48 小时，但只需将 --num_processes 调整为可用 GPU 的数量，就能轻松实现并行训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0144",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ce7c935ae58c7101",
      "translationZh": "量化 Mixtral",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0145",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb4f5e307eb114e5",
      "translationZh": "如上所述，这个模型面临的挑战是如何让它在消费级硬件上运行，以便任何人都能使用，因为仅以半精度（torch.float16）加载该模型就需要约 90GB 内存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0146",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cbbb61370b4a47a9",
      "translationZh": "借助 🤗 transformers 库，我们支持使用 QLoRA 和 GPTQ 等最先进的量化方法进行开箱即用的推理。你可以在文档的相应章节中进一步了解我们支持的量化方法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0147",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7b5fd70c66076616",
      "translationZh": "以 4 位量化加载 Mixtral",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0148",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2f6a1ada0d87b83",
      "translationZh": "如推理章节所示，你可以通过安装 bitsandbytes 库（pip install -U bitsandbytes），并向 from_pretrained 方法传入 load_in_4bit=True 标志，以 4 位量化加载 Mixtral。为了获得更好的性能，我们建议用户加载模型时设置 bnb_4bit_compute_dtype=torch.float16。请注意，你需要一块至少具有 30GB 显存的 GPU 设备，才能正常运行下方的代码片段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0149",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b021f6d5a97c2e42",
      "translationZh": "这种 4 位量化技术是在 QLoRA 论文中提出的，你可以在文档的相应章节或这篇文章中进一步了解它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0150",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "69933c5d9ba64a7d",
      "translationZh": "使用 GPTQ 加载 Mixtral",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0151",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d46ea1bee847b11",
      "translationZh": "GPTQ 算法是一种训练后量化技术，它对权重矩阵的每一行独立进行量化，以找到使误差最小的权重版本。这些权重被量化为 int4，但在推理过程中会即时还原为 fp16。与 4 位 QLoRA 不同，GPTQ 需要先用数据集对模型进行校准，才能进行量化。TheBloke 在 🤗 Hub 上分享了可直接使用的 GPTQ 模型，因此任何人都可以使用这些模型，而无须先自行校准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0152",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9411bacb8779922",
      "translationZh": "对于 Mixtral，我们必须调整校准方式，确保不对专家门控层进行量化，以获得更好的性能。量化模型的最终困惑度（越低越好）为 4.40，而半精度模型为 4.25。量化模型可以在这里找到，要使用 🤗 transformers 运行它，你首先需要更新 auto-gptq 和 optimum 库：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0153",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5efd02334b347b0",
      "translationZh": "你还需要从源码安装 transformers：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0154",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8fed6d3d8518c44",
      "translationZh": "安装完成后，只需使用 from_pretrained 方法加载 GPTQ 模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0155",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "443cf515a21d54f7",
      "translationZh": "请注意，无论使用 QLoRA 还是 GPTQ，都需要至少 30 GB 的 GPU 显存才能容纳该模型。如果像上面的示例一样使用 device_map=\"auto\"，将部分层卸载到 CPU，就可以在 24 GB 显存下运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0156",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1d15a8c35c7d0855",
      "translationZh": "免责声明与正在进行的工作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0157",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a17c034bb450d1d0",
      "translationZh": "量化：MoE 的量化是一个活跃的研究领域。上文展示了我们与 TheBloke 合作开展的一些初步实验，但我们期待随着对这一架构的了解加深，取得更多进展！未来几天和几周内，这一领域的发展将令人期待。此外，近期的研究成果，例如实现了 MoE 低于 1 比特量化的 QMoE，也可以应用于此。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0158",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "88ae5b6908d0bf48",
      "translationZh": "显存占用高：MoE 的推理速度非常快，但仍然需要大量显存（因此也需要昂贵的 GPU）。这使得在本地环境中使用它颇具挑战。MoE 非常适合拥有多台设备和大容量显存的环境。Mixtral 在半精度下需要 90GB 显存 🤯",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0159",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9459e12f91695e9b",
      "translationZh": "更多资源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0160",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1e29f02fe7f5e79c",
      "translationZh": "混合专家模型详解",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0161",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b800bd2a52fc9458",
      "translationZh": "Mixtral 专家混合模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0162",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c86a0119d5e288ef",
      "translationZh": "Hub 上的模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0163",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1db6b82b94f9e058",
      "translationZh": "开放式大语言模型排行榜",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0164",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7bd81df0b9dad8be",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Chat 上的聊天演示",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0165",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0166",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f11e48d529e9d90",
      "translationZh": "我们对 Mixtral 的发布感到非常兴奋！在接下来的几天里，准备好进一步了解微调和部署 Mixtral 的方法吧。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
